    "updated_at": "2023-09-09T18:38:49Z",
    "body": "I see. This is basically a symptom of https://github.com/whatwg/webidl/pull/902. If we properly propagated the active script, this would not be an issue. But we don't, and I've kind of given up on anyone implementing that.",
